WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:02.790
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:10.190
Today I am going to explain a family comedy
film called “Thunderpants”.

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:16.139
Watch out and take care!

00:00:16.139 --> 00:00:20.970
In the opening scene, the Smash family is
in a hospital room, waiting to welcome the

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:23.330
new member of their family.

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:29.359
Mrs. Smash struggles to give birth but after
a strong push, the baby flies out of her.

00:00:29.359 --> 00:00:33.000
It does several flips mid-air and has a full
head of hair.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.730
Thankfully, the doctor catches him and hands
him back to the family.

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:39.480
They name the baby boy, Patrick.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:44.449
While trying to take a family picture, Patrick
farts for the first time.

00:00:44.449 --> 00:00:46.989
Following that, it never stops.

00:00:46.989 --> 00:00:50.550
The parents can hardly sleep at night because
of the fart noises.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:55.149
Patrick’s strange condition would have been
tolerable to his parents if it weren’t for

00:00:55.149 --> 00:00:56.839
the foul smell.

00:00:56.839 --> 00:01:02.429
One time, Mr. Smash goes to tend the infant
in the middle of the night and has to retreat

00:01:02.429 --> 00:01:04.500
because of the pungent smell.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.969
Patrick won’t sleep the entire night and
only keeps passing gas.

00:01:08.969 --> 00:01:13.770
When it is time for a change, Mr. Smash comes
up with an innovative idea.

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:19.039
He ties a plastic garbage bag around Patrick’s
waist so the noise would be suppressed and

00:01:19.039 --> 00:01:21.310
the smell wouldn’t spread around the room.

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:28.430
However, the bag gets so big that it explodes
with a loud bang waking the entire neighborhood.

00:01:28.430 --> 00:01:33.320
As Patrick grows up into a toddler, Mr. Smash
gets more creative.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:38.579
He attaches Patrick’s behind to one end
of a pipe, that way his farts are transported

00:01:38.579 --> 00:01:39.579
outside.

00:01:39.579 --> 00:01:43.920
But the kid moves so much that the pipe detaches
from the other end.

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:49.359
One time, the pipe lands right before Mr.
Smash’s face, and the fart hospitalizes

00:01:49.359 --> 00:01:50.359
him.

00:01:50.359 --> 00:01:55.450
Following the event, he keeps himself busy
with work and hardly ever stays at home.

00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:59.829
Until eventually, he abandons the family and
leaves them forever.

00:01:59.829 --> 00:02:05.850
Patrick’s older sister Denise starts hating
him for destroying her perfect little family.

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:08.500
Even Mrs. Smash blames him for the trouble.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:12.190
Patrick is nervous and excited for his first
day of school.

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:16.980
He tries to fit in like everyone else but
he has to let out a fart only a few minutes

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:17.980
in.

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:20.390
The kids retreat away from him and laugh.

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:23.600
Except a boy named Alan who is kind to Patrick.

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:28.909
Alan has a condition called Anosmia and thus
lacks the sense of smell.

00:02:28.909 --> 00:02:31.970
The two become best friends and do everything
together.

00:02:31.970 --> 00:02:35.680
Patrick’s life doesn't get easier even after
getting a friend.

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:39.390
He is constantly bullied by a guy named Damon
at his school.

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:44.360
During the morning assembly, the kids are
asked to keep quiet for a special guest’s

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:45.360
speech.

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:50.470
Everyone does as told but Patrick lets out
a loud and pungent fart which gets him suspended

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:51.959
for a few days.

00:02:51.959 --> 00:02:55.970
Patrick wants to become an astronaut when
he grows up but he doesn’t know if that

00:02:55.970 --> 00:03:04.540
is possible because of his problem.

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:09.760
He frequently watches shows about space and
astronomy and is left disheartened when his

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:14.530
favorite astronaut says that an astronaut
should have complete control of himself.

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:19.409
Alan, on the other hand, wants to be a scientist
and invent a flying machine that doesn’t

00:03:19.409 --> 00:03:20.409
use fuel.

00:03:20.409 --> 00:03:24.230
Patrick asks for his help to create a device
that will suppress his farts.

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:30.099
Alan takes on the challenge and spends hours
in his backyard lab to create a fart collecting

00:03:30.099 --> 00:03:34.299
and suppressing device called the thunderpants.

00:03:34.299 --> 00:03:39.079
While Patrick is waiting for his friend outside
the lab, someone takes a picture of him without

00:03:39.079 --> 00:03:40.459
him knowing.

00:03:40.459 --> 00:03:45.020
After getting done, Alan makes Patrick wear
the device that collects his fats in a box

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:46.879
with the press of a button.

00:03:46.879 --> 00:03:51.390
Following that, the box is supposed to be
kept in a stabilizer that suppresses the fart

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:53.560
smell and disposes of it.

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:58.519
Patrick is beyond thankful to his friend now
that he has solved the biggest problem in

00:03:58.519 --> 00:03:59.860
his life.

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:04.989
Before this, he was only allowed to eat whole
grain food, so, he walks up to her sister

00:04:04.989 --> 00:04:07.500
and eats a spoonful of beans from her plate.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:12.870
Denise is left speechless because she is used
to mocking him for not being able to eat tasty

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:18.690
food like her.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:23.700
The following day at school, everyone is asked
to stay silent in the morning assembly.

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:27.250
The thunderpants work and no one hears Patrick
farting.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:32.220
During the lunch break, he asks Alan to help
him find his “unique talent” because his

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:38.380
favorite astronaut Gen. Ed Sheppard said on
a TV show that all the astronauts have one.

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:43.360
Alan bluntly tells his friend that he has
no unique talent, completely overlooking his

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:44.970
ability to fart.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:50.530
As they talk, the bully Damon asks for Patrick’s
lunch box and snatches his fart collecting

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:52.200
box instead.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:58.070
When he opens it, he is blasted with a pungent
smell and a green powder on his face.

00:04:58.070 --> 00:05:03.230
He gets so mad at Patrick for setting up the
prank that he ties him to the monkey bar as

00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:04.230
a punishment.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:08.230
The bully and his friends tear open the thunderpants
and beat him up.

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:11.940
They have to retreat when he lets out a smelly
fart yet again.

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:17.790
Everyone calls him a fartboy and makes fun
of him while poor Patrick stands humiliated.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:22.290
The next day, he doesn’t go to school, still
traumatized by the event.

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:27.010
In the evening, Alan comes to visit him with
a better thunderpant to replace the one that

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:28.060
was destroyed.

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:33.600
However, Patrick has lost the will to suppress
his farts because his dream to become an astronaut

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:36.290
isn’t going to come true anyway.

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:40.420
Alan realistically tells him that to become
an astronaut one should be at his physical

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:43.300
peak and has to pass several exams.

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:47.220
Patrick is far from healthy and is not smart
enough to pass them.

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:53.510
Alan apologizes for being so blunt but Patrick
walks away, knowing that he is telling the

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:54.510
truth.

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:58.790
When Alan returns home, two men outside Patrick’s
house keep an eye on him.

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:03.520
We see that they have several pictures of
both Alan and Patrick, almost as if they have

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:05.480
been spying on them.

00:06:05.480 --> 00:06:10.870
That week, Ms. Smash brings Patrick to the
hospital to get his condition checked professionally.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:14.520
The doctor is shocked to see that the kid
has two stomachs.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:21.260
He calls Patrick medical magic but also calls
his ability, a completely useless gift.

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:26.810
Patrick is overjoyed because having two stomachs
means he has a unique quality, which he thinks

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:29.180
makes him eligible to become an astronaut.

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:34.470
Meanwhile, Alan is planning to participate
in an invention competition where he has to

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:39.110
create a vehicle that will fly a hundred meters
without using fuel.

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:43.240
After finding out that his friend has two
stomachs, he plans to use Patrick’s farting

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:45.390
abilities to win the competition.

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:50.010
On the day of the said competition, they go
against many participants but none of their

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:53.540
devices are able to move to the threshold
distance.

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:57.200
Some devices fall apart while others do not
start at all.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:07:02.060
When it is Alan’s turn, they use Patrick’s
farts to make a device fly in the air.

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:04.950
The audience is left stunned in the first
half.

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:09.770
But soon, the device malfunctions, and the
fart is blown towards them.

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:13.670
Alan quickly repairs it and wins the competition.

00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:17.290
Following the win, Patrick gets enough courage
to stand up to Damon.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:22.880
He follows him to a forest and farts in his
face, making him fall unconscious.

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:29.210
As Patrick is smugly returning home that day,
he sees Alan get into a black car with a suitcase.

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:32.990
On inquiring to Alan’s father about his
whereabouts, he is given a letter.

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:38.630
In it, Alan wishes him luck for his dream
and says that he will be out for long.

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:43.230
His father claims he has moved to a different
country and won’t be back soon.

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:46.600
Without his best friend, Patrick doesn’t
know what to do.

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:52.690
He returns home and watches the news about
a group of astronauts being stranded in space.

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:56.780
Astronaut Ed Sheppard says that the team needs
a miracle to be brought back to the earth

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:57.780
safely.

00:07:57.780 --> 00:08:03.860
Later, the opera singer Sir John Osgood approaches
Patrick to help him in his next performance.

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:08.920
John had seen Patrick in the competition and
believes that his fart has the perfect pitch

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:11.190
that he needs at the end of his song.

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:15.800
When John promises to take him to a different
country, Patrick agrees to go, hoping that

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:17.630
he would find his best friend.

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:22.690
First, they travel to Paris and perform in
front of an audience consisting of world-famous

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:24.270
opera singers.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:29.230
At the end of the song, Patrick farts, helping
John reach a perfect pitch.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:35.099
John gets a standing ovation from the audience
who are unaware that Patrick was helping him.

00:08:35.099 --> 00:08:40.300
Following the show, John is noted as the best
opera singer in the work, much to his competitor,

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:43.289
Placido P. Placeedo’s annoyance.

00:08:43.289 --> 00:08:47.850
John and Patrick travel all over Europe singing
in various shows.

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:50.930
With every show, John’s popularity increases.

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:57.149
However, he urges Patrick to practice farting
every day for hours, letting him eat only

00:08:57.149 --> 00:08:59.500
after he hits the correct notes.

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:05.540
One day, while he is practicing, he is visited
by Placido who finds out about John’s little

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:06.540
secret.

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:11.750
He then mixes a laxative on a pie and feeds
it to Patrick, hoping to ruin John’s next

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:12.750
performance.

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:15.759
A few hours later, John is singing in one
of his shows.

00:09:15.759 --> 00:09:21.069
As usual, Patrick hits the highest notes with
his farts and even breaks wine glasses with

00:09:21.069 --> 00:09:22.070
the noise.

00:09:22.070 --> 00:09:27.000
The spotlight right above the stage dangles
dangerously because of the noise.

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:32.230
The laxative works and Patrick’s fart turns
pungent and loses its pitch.

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:36.019
An embarrassed John stands humiliated as the
audience laughs.

00:09:36.019 --> 00:09:41.600
Moments later, Placido gets on the stage and
drags Patrick in front of everyone revealing

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:42.900
John’s secret.

00:09:42.900 --> 00:09:47.649
Just then, the spotlight falls on him, killing
him instantly.

00:09:47.649 --> 00:09:52.490
Both John and Patrick are convinced of murder
since the falling of the spotlight was their

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:53.490
fault.

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:58.110
Several people testify against the poor kid,
saying that he has always been cruel.

00:09:58.110 --> 00:10:01.019
Damon accuses him of trying to kill him with
his fart.

00:10:01.019 --> 00:10:05.459
When the reporters ask Patrick about his thoughts
on the situation, he claims that he was with

00:10:05.459 --> 00:10:10.310
John to look for his best friend and didn’t
know Placido was going to die.

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:15.759
Alan, from another country, sees Patrick on
TV and asks him to be brought to the country

00:10:15.759 --> 00:10:16.879
as well.

00:10:16.879 --> 00:10:23.420
Back in the court, Patrick is proven guilty
of all charges and is given the death penalty.

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:26.220
Right when he is about to be shot, a miracle
happens.

00:10:26.220 --> 00:10:31.689
A US special agent comes to save him and legally
brings him to their headquarters.

00:10:31.689 --> 00:10:36.700
He is also the same person who had been spying
on Alan and Patrick for a long time.

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:39.589
Patrick is flown to America in a private jet.

00:10:39.589 --> 00:10:45.550
On landing, he reunites with Alan who claims
that he was contacted by astronaut Ed Sheppard.

00:10:45.550 --> 00:10:50.110
The astronaut recognized him as a genius kid
and recruited him to save the ones who are

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:51.990
stranded in space.

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:56.300
Since it was supposed to be a secret, Alan
couldn’t tell Patrick before leaving.

00:10:56.300 --> 00:11:00.230
He apologizes for being a bad friend and the
two reconcile.

00:11:00.230 --> 00:11:05.610
Patrick is also told that only he, who has
two stomachs can save the stranded astronauts

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:06.749
in space.

00:11:06.749 --> 00:11:10.259
He is beyond happy to finally get to be a
“spaceman”.

00:11:10.259 --> 00:11:14.079
They meet Ed Sheppard who welcomes Patrick
to their team.

00:11:14.079 --> 00:11:18.529
Following that, Alan introduces Patrick to
his team of little scientists recruited from

00:11:18.529 --> 00:11:19.930
around the world.

00:11:19.930 --> 00:11:24.790
They inform him of a device they have created
that will gather the energy from his farts

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:26.600
and multiply it.

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:31.759
Using the technique, Patrick will thus have
to launch the rescue rocket to space.

00:11:31.759 --> 00:11:34.920
Starting that day, he is trained to become
an astronaut.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:39.629
The officials are worried because he has failed
all mental and physical tests that an astronaut

00:11:39.629 --> 00:11:40.769
should pass.

00:11:40.769 --> 00:11:45.959
However, Ed Sheppard is confident that the
kid will rescue the stranded team.

00:11:45.959 --> 00:11:50.269
After a week of training, Patrick is put in
a spacesuit, ready for the mission.

00:11:50.269 --> 00:11:54.370
The entire world watches in awe as the kid
boards the rocket.

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:59.040
However, Alan is informed that there is a
seventy percent chance that the rocket will

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:01.519
blow up shortly after the liftoff.

00:12:01.519 --> 00:12:06.120
He tells his friend of the possibilities but
Patrick doesn’t back down.

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:11.029
On a count of ten, He lets out a fart and
the rocket lifts off the station.

00:12:11.029 --> 00:12:15.910
Everyone in the control room cheers for the
kid but soon, they lose all communication.

00:12:15.910 --> 00:12:21.100
As they start to lose hope, the communication
turns back on, and Patrick finally reaches

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:22.100
space.

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:25.899
In the following scene, we see him bring down
the stranded astronauts.

00:12:25.899 --> 00:12:30.990
He is welcomed with loud cheers and praised
by everyone in the world.

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:35.380
